      "content": "it's not that simple. i've talked to people. they're just being nice because they have to. but when i look at my kids, i see them dealing with my mood swings and my mess, and it just feels so unfair to them. like i'm just a parasite. i can't shake the feeling that they'd be better off if they didn't have to worry about me anymore.",
